  <item>
    <title>演唱会是一场巨大的集体冥想|Vol.4</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6652a514c59d1e5757b1ac16</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6652a514c59d1e5757b1ac16</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近，阿发和小张开始频繁出入演唱会现场了。短暂逃离现实世界之余，我们也很想来聊一聊演唱会为什么令我们如此上头，以及对我们看过的演唱会做一个小测评。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎朋友们在评论区分享你的演唱会感受！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期话题直达：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 《歌手》以及五旬老太守国门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="704">11:44</a> &nbsp;演唱会就是一场大型的集体冥想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> &nbsp;小张和阿发的五月天时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1014">16:54</a> &nbsp;鸟巢安检，你别太嚣张</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1396">23:16</a> &nbsp;关于五月天假唱的掰头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a> 小张测评凤凰传奇演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 阿发测评邓紫棋演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2703">45:03</a> &nbsp;太原文旅上大分！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2987">49:47</a> 演唱会就是去线下感受人与人之间的连接！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3542">59:02</a> 给高考考生送祝福！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lucDqwBjrxe2rPiifjCNJWc0KbNC.m4a" length="54587654" type="audio/mp4"/>
