  <item>
    <title>无脑营销靠边站，我的妈妈你别管 | Vol.3</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6640917bb813c7172b8c1cd0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6640917bb813c7172b8c1cd0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 May 2024 09:52:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们好，又是一年母亲节。祝妈妈们，快乐，悦己，昂扬。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这题，我们会！</span></p><span></span><p><span>天气转暖，小张和阿发的状态也变好了很多！这期我们轻松地聊母亲节，到了有趣的地方会哈哈大笑，面对不好的营销语一起开麦吐槽！欢迎收听！评论！关注！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿发（对妈妈真情流露版）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小张（终于不用蹭母亲节热点了版）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕗时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:00:14</a> 两个主播最近过得怎么样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">00:06:09</a> 给妈妈们的祝福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">00:07:42</a> 有些品牌方，不会蹭可以不蹭的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">00:17:33</a> 我们共读的一本书《我的母亲做保洁》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2276">00:37:56</a> 一本类似的书《我在北京送快递》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">00:50:20</a> 母亲节，我们想到这些文艺作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3261">00:54:21</a> 妈，如果你听到这里，我想对你说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3411">00:56:51</a> 我会当一个“妈”吗？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luo9fbq3ybXScxVE1Qs59rFP_VKI.m4a" length="60618020" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqoVGQuIaK_QC6JfHiIk13F5LQVH.jpg"/>
