  <item>
    <title>综艺闲聊：你们这些节目能不能有点新意！| Vol.2</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663b29c3dec649c5f535f38f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663b29c3dec649c5f535f38f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 May 2024 07:29:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们聊了聊综艺。说起来，阿发和小张都不是热衷综艺的观众，真情实感追完的节目更是少之又少。但综艺节目，又在我们的生命里占据了不少的位置。纠结再三，我们还是决定聊一聊，因为我们想要表达！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这一期里，我们邀请小张的朋友小王和我们一起聊了各种综艺类型，聊了自己的挚爱节目，也大胆开麦吐槽了。可能有点无聊，但没关系，开始即成功！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你恰巧是综艺相关的从业者，我们也很想邀请你来和我们录制一期节目，想听听你从专业角度说说自己的看法。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> &nbsp;最近都看了什么综艺节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> &nbsp;情感综艺大开麦，再见爱人你欠我的用什么还</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="897">14:57</a> &nbsp;可以充当电子布洛芬的治愈节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2112">35:12</a> &nbsp;一喜二喜还有我们永远怀念的脱口秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> &nbsp;想看谁的喜剧专场！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> &nbsp;谁的bgm响了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3929">65:29</a> &nbsp;秀人是一个循环</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4436">73:56</a> &nbsp;设计一档综艺节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4650">77:30</a> &nbsp;诚邀综艺节目从业者聊聊专业视角</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljcInnabyrv0pf0nnnrRnKiIT2yJ.m4a" length="76875106" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:19:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqoVGQuIaK_QC6JfHiIk13F5LQVH.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>世界读书日：图书行业“入圈”两年，我们还热爱阅读吗？| Vol.1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6624f661200abebe6e43261e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6624f661200abebe6e43261e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Apr 2024 11:20:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好我是阿发，我和小张的第一期播客就要上线了，这是我近期最开心的事情之一。</span></p><span></span><p><span>想了很久，取名这题我会，表达一种对生活没来由的自信。英文名叫I know，这个是小张取的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们两个目前都是图书行业从业者，会在播客里讨论我们的生活、读书日常、我们都爱的喜剧等等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们希望它是有趣的、幽默的、独特的，或者至少是不停更的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一期，我们聊的是两个人共同都很会的议题：世界读书日。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望大家听得开心，如果能关注就更好了：）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkBiQ-dchIap6SPrVS8bUl3NfHcI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（小张两年前给我发的表情包）</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>@阿发 @小张</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>时间戳：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:00:30</a> 我们为什么做这样一档播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">00:04:58</a> 什么时候开始有阅读的习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">00:10:56</a> 曾经读到什么书，惊叹图书是件美好的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">00:17:20</a> 最近在看什么书？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">00:27:44</a> 如何确定自己想要阅读的就是这本书？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1862">00:31:02</a> 人生之书！我逢人就推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2301">00:38:21</a> 欣赏不了 这书我就是读不下去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2862">00:47:42</a> 图书营销与读书博主之间的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">00:52:00</a> 我们喜欢/经常看的读书up主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3471">00:57:51</a> 和读书博主们交流的快乐与尴尬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3560">00:59:20</a> 羡慕爆火的书：《绿血》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3959">01:05:59</a> 图书行业的下头瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4265">01:11:05</a> 在图书行业，我们那些快乐的、有成就感的瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>提到的书：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>《看见》柴静</span></p><span></span><p><span>《可是我偏偏不喜欢》吴晓乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>《了不起的我》陈海贤</span></p><span></span><p><span>《金色梦乡》伊坂幸太郎</span></p><span></span><p><span>《我们为什么要睡觉》马修·沃克</span></p><span></span><p><span>《贼拉魔性东北话》马晓晴</span></p><span></span><p><span>《应得的权利》凯特·曼恩</span></p><span></span><p><span>《鱼不存在》露露·米勒</span></p><span></span><p><span>《月亮与六便士》毛姆</span></p><span></span><p><span>《面纱》毛姆</span></p><span></span><p><span>《寻欢作乐》毛姆</span></p><span></span><p><span>《绿血》宋迅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhiWamXpN4kU6EYDZ2unuCGXjsxV.m4a" length="75039875" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqoVGQuIaK_QC6JfHiIk13F5LQVH.jpg"/>
